WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.077 --> 00:00:09.832
Finally Ivy couldn't take it anymore.

2
00:00:09.833 --> 00:00:14.291
She jumped into the water, and Ezra jumped in after her.

3
00:00:14.292 --> 00:00:16.866
She looked around for Glen.

4
00:00:16.867 --> 00:00:20.257
"Where is he?" she thought in a panic.

5
00:00:20.258 --> 00:00:26.457
Glen swam to the surface and gasped for air.

6
00:00:26.458 --> 00:00:29.998
"I thought you drowned!" Ivy shouted.

7
00:00:29.999 --> 00:00:34.500
"I'm fine. But those rocks are too heavy," Glen said.

8
00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:37.416
"Our plan won't work."

9
00:00:37.417 --> 00:00:41.914
"You mean, your plan won't work!" Ivy said.

10
00:00:41.915 --> 00:00:45.735
Out of the water, the kids grabbed their towels. "That

11
00:00:45.736 --> 00:00:50.082
was a terrible idea, Ezra," Glen said. "You

12
00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:54.823
called it incredible , remember?" Ezra said.

13
00:00:54.824 --> 00:00:59.417
"Wait—I have the best idea ever!" Glen said.

14
00:00:59.418 --> 00:01:02.957
"Let's drill holes in the other teams' canoes."

15
00:01:02.958 --> 00:01:08.599
Ivy rolled her eyes. "Everyone will see the holes."

16
00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:10.428
Glen sighed.

17
00:01:10.429 --> 00:01:17.457
"Oh well. I guess we'll just have to think about ice cream—and paddle fast!"

18
00:01:17.458 --> 00:01:19.792
*** It was the day of the

19
00:01:19.793 --> 00:01:23.957
race. Campers lined up by the lake to watch the three teams

20
00:01:23.958 --> 00:01:27.789
compete. The canoers put on life vests and grabbed

21
00:01:27.790 --> 00:01:29.814
paddles. Ivy felt

22
00:01:29.815 --> 00:01:34.599
terrible. But it wasn't just the thought of losing the race that was bothering

23
00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:41.128
her. "I must have caught what Annie had," she said. "My throat is

24
00:01:41.129 --> 00:01:45.818
sore." Ezra looked concerned. "Should you go to the

25
00:01:45.819 --> 00:01:51.478
infirmary?" Ivy shook her head. "Nurse Kramer will never believe

26
00:01:51.479 --> 00:01:55.300
me. I'll get through the race somehow."

27
00:01:55.301 --> 00:01:59.795
"Look, Annie's still not back," Glen said.

28
00:01:59.796 --> 00:02:02.866
"That means we have a chance!"

29
00:02:02.867 --> 00:02:07.781
"You're right," Ezra said. "We can still win!"

30
00:02:07.782 --> 00:02:14.052
Ivy coughed. "Let's get this over with. I need a nap."

31
00:02:14.053 --> 00:02:19.728
"Canoers, take your positions!" Private shouted.

32
00:02:19.729 --> 00:02:23.999
Everyone climbed into the canoes.

33
00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.247
Private blew her whistle.

34
00:02:26.248 --> 00:02:30.232
Blue took the lead, with Red close behind.

35
00:02:30.233 --> 00:02:35.418
The Yellow team's canoe went off to the right.

36
00:02:35.419 --> 00:02:40.532
"What stroke do we use to go straight ahead?" Ezra asked.

37
00:02:40.533 --> 00:02:44.339
"How should I know?" Glen said.

38
00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:47.800
Red and Blue were now halfway across the lake.

39
00:02:47.801 --> 00:02:50.457
They were almost tied.

40
00:02:50.458 --> 00:02:55.681
Ivy and the boys paddled hard, but their canoe kept going in a circle.

41
00:02:55.682 --> 00:02:59.457
They could hear kids laughing from the shore.

42
00:02:59.458 --> 00:03:04.511
Glen groaned. "This is humiliating."

43
00:03:04.512 --> 00:03:09.457
Blue was ahead, but Red shot forward in the final seconds.

44
00:03:09.458 --> 00:03:13.749
"Yay, Red!" Campers cheered.

45
00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:17.097
Yellow floated in the middle of the lake. "We

46
00:03:17.098 --> 00:03:25.791
got last place," Ezra said sadly. "No ice cream for us." Ivy

47
00:03:25.792 --> 00:03:28.626
sneezed twice and groaned. "Forget

48
00:03:28.627 --> 00:03:36.166
the ice cream. Get me a box of tissues!" ***

49
00:03:36.167 --> 00:03:40.668
A few days later, a group of campers stood by the camp bus.

50
00:03:40.669 --> 00:03:45.250
A sign on the bus read, Great Job, Sports Day Winners!

51
00:03:45.251 --> 00:03:47.642
The Red canoe team boarded the bus.

52
00:03:47.643 --> 00:03:51.499
Huck climbed on behind them, pumping his fists.

53
00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:59.452
"I scream, you scream, we all scream for ice cream!" the winners shouted.

54
00:03:59.453 --> 00:04:03.240
The doors closed, and the bus pulled away.

55
00:04:03.241 --> 00:04:06.717
"Those lucky winners," Glen mumbled.

56
00:04:06.718 --> 00:04:12.811
Ezra sighed. "Time for the soccer game."

57
00:04:12.812 --> 00:04:19.732
Glen stared at Ivy. "Why are you smiling? You hate soccer.

58
00:04:19.733 --> 00:04:23.279
And you wanted to leave camp to go to Frosty Freeze."

59
00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:27.988
"I showed Larry the drawings for my graphic novel," Ivy said.

60
00:04:27.989 --> 00:04:34.749
"He loved my zombie drawing so much, he paid me ten dollars for it!" She

61
00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:38.676
pulled a bill out of her pocket and waved it around. "When

62
00:04:38.677 --> 00:04:44.957
I'm a famous artist, I'll buy us all the ice cream we can eat." Just

63
00:04:44.958 --> 00:04:49.486
then Chuck and Buck ran by, kicking a soccer ball. Buck

64
00:04:49.487 --> 00:04:51.707
kicked the ball hard. It

65
00:04:51.708 --> 00:04:54.399
sailed through the air and— bonk!

66
00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:56.909
It hit Ivy on the head.

67
00:04:56.910 --> 00:05:03.766
"Ouch!" she cried, still smiling.

